      "parent_ids": [
        "6d4a4636206c4c0506466177cba1b5f04fa73e09"
      ],
      "title": "dfilter: Forbid protocol filter names beginning with '-'",
      "message": "dfilter: Forbid protocol filter names beginning with '-'\n\nReducing the namespace for protocol names makes the display filter grammar\nsimpler and less ambiguous and error prone. We can't easily impose\nstricter restrictions without breaking backward compatibility but names\nstarting with '-' are a pathological case because of negative numbers\nand byte slices and in the unlikely event that any such names exist\nthey should be fixed.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2021-10-15T17:09:22.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "João Valverde",
      "committer_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "committed_date": "2021-10-15T17:29:34.000+01:00",
